<p class="sub">Help for the Paradise Exteriors event-planning and show-operations app.</p>
<h2>Common fixes</h2>
<ul><li>Use the reload button in the app header to refresh current operating data.</li><li>If a screen is stale after an update, fully close and reopen the app.</li><li>If show history or annual-plan detail does not load, confirm the device has an internet connection and retry.</li><li>Do not treat an executed agreement as proof that a payment cleared; use the app’s payment evidence and status controls.</li></ul>
